<tr><td align=3D"left" class=3D"text" style=3D"background:#FFFFFF;font-size=
:0px;padding:0 16px;word-break:break-word;"><div style=3D"font-family:Georg=
ia, serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px;text-align:left;c=
olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">For the FA Cup, the early rounds are the j=
uice. The first round proper to be played out over the long weekend is look=
ing, well, proper. And on Saturday at 3pm GMT, a proper time, 31 ties will =
kick off. No VAR, either. At the stage when the bottom two Football League =
divisions join the competition, focus remains on those non-league clubs fig=
hting for the honour of the pyramid =E2=80=A6</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Mansfield v Macclesfield<br></stro=
ng>In January, Macclesfield <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian=
.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0B=
xnPgnkAvYznwxJdVubkjtifGL_QE9f-8248YYOarhcLd9v-ztTnc8onC7d_HN5SyISj7LCr2-rn=
se95hhGXio_yJ13tIiScpDeH-ujB2NoyB4L1E-uZ7K1N5BcvSOpIWTHNl8OWpCjqXiU3jnzd2N2=
1wXJNNO3XQ517Vsclck6dtqU7cUoYvowgwyg07y-xOfzuRKAD1kJHEfwSVJzuzY5NMDHxAUxmIL=
C3ujZOImdn3TvQ/4vi/9_dPLjueQUKJN0RDm1RkVg/h28/h001.xkFdDH6AJUvnD3MHBUBUYCa8=
niMnDdKg3LcF9r6a4d4" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">achieved the greatest shock<=
/a> in the competition=E2=80=99s history, knocking out the holders, Crystal=
 Palace, in the third round. John Rooney=E2=80=99s National League North te=
am head through the Pennines to face soundalikes Mansfield. Those from Macc=
lesfield often find themselves having to correct others on coming from the =
Cheshire town rather than the one in Nottinghamshire. Macclesfield are such=
 a modern club these days they have a sporting director in Keith Curle, a f=
ormer Stags manager. Curle and current Mansfield boss Nigel Clough were Eng=
land teammates at Euro 92, of which <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.the=
guardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHECiShp5WmHC=
Ytm7ZwWpOvCBYcH0xUCBP6KebKPNkj9LVGcZ30WBruN7ZPg1tZmtPmf0tdUbxPbQdtfVKTLG53V=
juJt6-QJwf4LWU-e03E-ngqs_a7aBTcuXKQMAwJI-bBcSt0VHS5VeJj4z7acCT2p7nUlF-c9JXF=
Pa5JaYkgBCmQul6LyjtuUBl4NwK993OVj3G4S8_KxSPNPW6z82ixk_yGhMsznLlKOcwEb-cNB3Z=
EjF-89vYYZW1YltxMw8gtA/4vi/9_dPLjueQUKJN0RDm1RkVg/h29/h001.kNRn-oDtUJWpJrkE=
fGllXk0HTrxEN0PeOjwaITvDvFA" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">the less said the be=
tter</a>.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Bradford City v Marine<br></strong=
>Merseyside=E2=80=99s most authentic, proper football club? Neither Everton=
 nor Liverpool can compete with Crosby=E2=80=99s Marine. When modern footba=
ll gets too much, the temptation to savour a pie and pint at Rossett Park, =
the club of Roly Howard, legendary manager for 33 years, becomes strong. On=
 Saturday, Marine travel to Bradford City, on something of a slide since Gr=
aham Alexander de-camped to manage Preston.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Burton v AFC Rushden &amp; Diamond=
s<br></strong>Fans at Burton=E2=80=99s Pirelli Stadium will see Billy Sharp=
=E2=80=99s comeback at 76. One of the Football League=E2=80=99s very top ma=
rksmen, the Championship=E2=80=99s all-time scorer on 130 recently retired =
but has returned with AFC Rushden &amp; Diamonds, the phoenix club of a for=
mer temporary employer for whom he scored his first goal when loaned there =
in 2005, before they were liquidated six years later. A striker who defines=
 the term =E2=80=9Cwell-travelled=E2=80=9D =E2=80=93 including a spell at L=
A Galaxy =E2=80=93 blink and you will miss Sharp, as the prodigal return is=
 for one game only, in search of his 300th career goal. He departed Doncast=
er on the tantalising total of 299.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Plymouth Argyle v Alvechurch<br></=
strong>Alvechurch, representing a Worcestershire village, was previously mo=
st famous for giving the world Alan =E2=80=9CSmudger=E2=80=9D Smith (incide=
ntally another member of that Euro 92 squad). The less said about his subst=
itution for old pal Gary Lineker against Sweden the better. Smith=E2=80=99s=
 alma mater, in the Southern League, travel to Plymouth Argyle, led by Tom =
Cleverley, the former brand turned aspirant tracksuit manager. Two seasons =
ago the Pilgrims=E2=80=99 progress down to League One was offset <a href=3D=
"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyT=
NtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHECoBtcQjat6FvTX4oDJNDqNM_1KeIbYjcAQ_xt-zd0RZrO_iK83nGSmG6=
36BPbxBHOS6xlB0LU1VRPXJrLC3slsBH_6kdSO1Z8jqDW5g8RF2D64W9XxSRU9wTGHQvqQDbDIF=
PBwFJw4qhrtONknNuOjnAtQwlmubeQVetSs1b5xss6Pyu8urc0HL7c4iqd_iwRVuIjKYKqhFGVa=
BS_D44D3mnNQSqeb8f6Q2o3-rGHQUw/4vi/9_dPLjueQUKJN0RDm1RkVg/h30/h001.KFG-hB9k=
XXegTRjC7mV0SKXRbVeheV201zxinhI3K20" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">by beating e=
ventual Premier League champions Liverpool</a> in the third round. Should t=
hat fall flat, the city gets another helping on Monday night when Parkway t=
ake on Berkhamsted, the commuter town=E2=80=99s community club.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Cray Wanderers v Stockport County<=
/strong><br>Representing the Isthmian League are Cray Wanderers, who claim =
to be London=E2=80=99s oldest football club, whose origins are traced to 18=
60, older perhaps than even Notts County. Playing in Chislehurst, best know=
n for its caves, =E2=80=9CThe Wands=E2=80=9D take on high-flying League One=
 Stockport County, led by The Wire=E2=80=99s Jimmy McNulty.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Peterborough v Reading<br></strong=
>All that and a Savage family reunion as the Posh, managed by Robbie, host =
son Charlie=E2=80=99s team, the Royals. The Cup properly runneth over.</p>
